COMPILATION OF: E49A3

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49A3

   1 a 0000 E49A3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P1] the inverted compare with ^=.  [C072] pins DR's ^=
   4 a 0006      skip byte as CA in every sampled family, and arm 4 lowered the
   5 a 0006      FIXED TEST ^= as a [C072] SYNTHESIS: E48E7 measured C2 only,
   6 a 0006      and C330 says so.  This probe measures the CA byte in the
   7 a 0006      ?SCCCM family itself, with the member on the left. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 name char(3),
  11 c 0006       2 nxt fixed bin(15);
  12 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  13 c 0006   if rec.name ^= 'AB' then k = 1;
  14 c 001D   put list('K=', k);
  15 c 003F   stop;
  16 a 0042 end E49A3;

CODE SIZE = 0042
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 3879
END  COMPILATION
